{
 "_notes": {
   "steps": "One per served BehaviourGraph (key = graph asset name). instance = QuestNodeInstanceId (the graph's baked id, else a stable made-up one), node = QuestNodeId (the original ids where a Queue Story Graph names them: 231 tutorial, 287, 387, 395, 403; ours otherwise), poi = PoiSettings asset under assets/_bundledassets/story/poi_settings/, mode = PoiDisplayMode (1 Normal, 2 CloseFollow, 4 Hunt, 5 Auto), ttl = seconds after activation before an Auto node fires (ExpiringQuestNodeInstances, Unix seconds).",
   "edges": "step -> EndBehaviourGraph output -> what changes: \"x\" activates step x, \"-x\" retires x, {step, if: [fact, op, value]} activates only when the fact (as just reported by the graph) matches. The step that sent the output always retires. An output that isn't listed (lost fight, mid-graph progress like two_left) keeps the step active so it can be retried. S00 order is from the graph assets; prolog_02 and S01 are inferred from journal steps (fact 10000 + quest id) per output (quest_catalog.json output_facts) plus the wiki walkthroughs (tools/data_sources/wiki/quests_pages.json) - verify by playing.",
   "not served": "free-roam / injectable graphs (*_ig, *_short), quest-item buttons (qi_*: no quest items in the inventory yet), timers we can't place (s01hq03_timer*, s01hq05_timer, s01mq02_potion, s01mq06_timer, s01hq04_too_late), dev checkpoints (CT_* outputs, fact 190), s01_chickentest."
 },
